      <PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>Our mission is to present the rich art form of Flamenco through teaching and performing its dance, music, and Spanish-language singing. Alma Flamenca will broaden San Diegos artistic horizon, serving as a hub in the community to share our Spanish heritage, by bringing the most talented local, national and international artists into a Flamenco ensemble. We strive to discover the innate profoundness in this art form and enrich our lives on many levels. Our goal is to make Flamenco more than just entertainment and inspire all members of the community to become a Flamenco enthusiast, especially the younger generations to fall in love with Flamenco and consider it as an artistic discipline</PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>
      <ProgramSrvcAccomplishmentGrp>
        <DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>Sucessfully demonstated educational programs to the public and the Organization's member that support the stated exempt organization's purpose of presenting the rich art form of Flamenco through teaching and performing its dance, music, and Spanish-language singing. Alma Flamenca broadens San Diegos artistic horizon, and serves as a hub in the community to share Spanish heritage, bringing the most talented local, national and international artists into a Flamenco ensemble. We discover the innate profoundness in this art form and enrich our lives on many levels. Our goal is to make Flamenco more than just entertainment and inspire all members of the community to become Flamenco enthusiasts, especially the younger generations to fall in love with Flamenco and consider it as an artistic discipline</DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>
